From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:51:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SP: desktop OpenGL from an SDL that defaults to OpenGL ES

An SDL built for EGL with OpenGL ES only (no desktop OpenGL of its own,
as for Mesa without GLX: the ODROID-GO Ultra's panfrost) starts with an
OpenGL ES 2 profile, and the fixed-function renderer got a context it
cannot draw with. Ask for a desktop OpenGL compatibility context there;
Mesa gives its highest compatibility version (3.1 on panfrost).
---
 SP/code/sdl/sdl_glimp.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/SP/code/sdl/sdl_glimp.c b/SP/code/sdl/sdl_glimp.c
index 94d1d872..ef2533bb 100644
--- a/SP/code/sdl/sdl_glimp.c
+++ b/SP/code/sdl/sdl_glimp.c
@@ -652,6 +652,21 @@ static int GLimp_SetMode(int mode, qboolean fullscreen, qboolean noborder, qbool
 
 #ifdef USE_OPENGLES
 		SDL_GL_SetAttribute( SDL_GL_CONTEXT_MAJOR_VERSION, 1 );
+#else
+		{
+			// An SDL built for EGL with OpenGL ES only (no desktop OpenGL
+			// of its own, as for Mesa without GLX) starts with an OpenGL ES 2
+			// profile: ask for desktop OpenGL, Mesa gives its highest
+			// compatibility version
+			int profileMask = 0;
+
+			SDL_GL_GetAttribute( SDL_GL_CONTEXT_PROFILE_MASK, &profileMask );
+			if ( profileMask == SDL_GL_CONTEXT_PROFILE_ES ) {
+				SDL_GL_SetAttribute( SDL_GL_CONTEXT_PROFILE_MASK, SDL_GL_CONTEXT_PROFILE_COMPATIBILITY );
+				SDL_GL_SetAttribute( SDL_GL_CONTEXT_MAJOR_VERSION, 2 );
+				SDL_GL_SetAttribute( SDL_GL_CONTEXT_MINOR_VERSION, 1 );
+			}
+		}
 #endif
 
 		SDL_GL_SetAttribute( SDL_GL_RED_SIZE, perChannelColorBits );
